Reaction of Aldehyde and Methyl Acrylate in Ionic Liquid. In a oven-dried
flask, aldehyde (1.00 mmol) and DABCO (230 mg, 2.01 mmol) were dissolved
in Ar-degassed [bmTr][PF6] (14c) (0.1 mL). Methyl acrylate (173 mg, 2.01
