$DATUM 1-(3,5-Bis(tert-butyldimethylsilyloxy)phenyl)prop-2-en-1-ol (27). To a
solution of 4 (2.0 g, 5.4 mmol) in THF (34.0 mL) at 0 °C was added
vinylmagnesium bromide (12.4 mL of a 0.7 M solution in THF, 8.7 mmol)
dropwise via syringe over 30 min. The solution was allowed to stir for 30
minutes at 0 °C, then allowed to warm to room temperature and stirred for
3 hours. The reaction was quenched with a saturated solution of NH4Cl in
water. The aqueous solution was extracted with ether (3 × 50 mL), dried
(Na2SO4), and concentrated. 27 as a colorless oil (2.2 g, 99%) after
purification (SiO2, 3% EtOAc/Hexanes). 1H (400 MHz, CDCl3): δ 6.47 (d, J
= 2.4 Hz, 2H), 6.24 (d, J = 2.4 Hz, 1H), 5.99 (ddd, J = 16.3, 10.3, 5.9
Hz, 1H), 5.32 (dd, J = 16.3, 2.7 Hz, 1H), 5.18 (dd, J = 10.3, 2.8 Hz,
1H), 5.06 (d, J = 5.9, Hz, 1H), 0.96 (s, 18H), 0.18 (s, 9H); 13C (100
MHz, CDCl3): δ 156.68, 144.52, 115.15, 111.30, 111.31, 75.08, 25.68,
18.20, -4.39; HRMS: calculated mass = 417.2257 (M+Na), observed mass =
417.2260 (M+Na); IR (CHCl3, cm-1): 3458, 2956, 2931, 2858, 1790, 1451,
1335, 1255, 1164, 831.
