2H), 4.21-4.14 (m, 1H), 2.24 (q, J = 6.9 Hz, 2H), 2.22-2.09 (m, 1H), 1.88
(q, J = 6.6 Hz, 2H), 1.43-1.33 (m, 1H), 1.43 (br. d, J = 7.9 Hz, 2H),
0.95 (d, J = 6.8 Hz, 3H), 0.88 (d, J = 6.9 Hz, 3H), 0.00 (s, 9H); 13C NMR
