$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Triethyl-hex-5-en-3-ynyloxy-sliane: To a
stirred solution of vinyl bromide (1.0 M solution of THF, 18 mL, 18.0
mmol), Pd(PPh3)4 (208 mg, 0.18 mmol), CuI (91.6 mg, 0.48 mmol), and Et3N
(3.4 mL, 24.0 mmol) was added a solution of but-3-ynyloxy-triethylsilane
(2.21 g, 12.0 mmol) in THF (6 mL) via a syringe pump over 1 hour. The
reaction mixture was stirred at room temperature for 3 hours and then it
was filtered through Celite. The solvent was removed in vacuo.
Purification of residue by flash chromatography (SiO2: Rf = 0.72,
hexanes/EtOAc = 20/1) gave the enyne product.
2-Hydroxy3-naphthalen-1-yl-hexa-3,5-dienoic acid ethyl ester, yield 70%.
1H NMR (mixture of atropisomers, 500 MHz, DMSO, 27 °C): 7.95-7.87 (m,
2H), 7.75 (m, 0.5H), 7.66 (m, 0.5H), 7.53-7.43 (m, 3H), 7.31 (dd, J =
1.0, 7.0 Hz, 0.5H), 7.22 (dd, J = 1.0, 7.0 Hz, 0.5H), 6.78 (dd, J = 1.0,
11.0 Hz, 0.5H), 6.73 (dd, J = 1.0, 11.0 Hz, 0.5H), 6.06 (d, J = 6.0 Hz,
0.5H), 6.02 (d, J = 6.0 Hz, 0.5H), 5.76 (ddd, J = 10.0, 11.0, 13.0 Hz,
0.5H), 5.64 (ddd, J = 10.0, 11.0, 13.0 Hz, 0.5H), 5.37 (dd, J = 2.0, 13.0
Hz, 0.5H), 5.34 (dd, J = 2.0, 13.0 Hz, 0.5H), 5.01 (dd, J = 2.0, 10.0 Hz,
0.5H), 4.98 (dd, J = 2.0, 10.0 Hz, 0.5H), 4.92 (dd, J = 1.0, 6.0 Hz,
0.5H), 4.84 (dd, J = 1.0, 6.0 Hz, 0.5H), 3.91-3.67 (m, 2H), 0.93 (t, J =
7.0 Hz, 1.5H), 0.68 (t, J = 7.0 Hz, 1.5H). 1H NMR (mixture of
atropisomers, 500 MHz, DMSO, 130 °C): 7.91-7.85 (m, 2H), 7.79 (br, 1H),
7.48 (br, 3H), 7.28 (br, 1H), 6.78 (br, 1H), 5.78 (br, 1H), 5.44-5.31 (m,
2H), 4.98 (m, 1H), 4.89 (m, 1H), 3.93 (br, 2H), 1.03-0.89 (m, 3H). 13C
NMR (mixture of atropisomers, 125 MHz, DMSO, 27 °C): 171.5, 171.4, 139.4,
138.6, 135.2, 134.3, 133.3, 133.2, 133.1, 133.0, 131.4, 131.0, 130.8,
129.4, 128.3, 128.0, 127.8, 127.6, 127.3, 126.2, 126.1, 125.9, 125.8,
125.7, 125.5, 125.3, 125.2, 125.1, 119.7, 119.5, 75.2, 74.4, 60.2, 60.1,
13.7, 13.3.13C NMR (mixture of atropisomers, 125 MHz, DMSO, 130 °C):
170.7, 139.0, 138.4, 132.8, 132.7, 130.2, 129.3, 127.3, 126.9, 126.5,
125.2, 124.8, 124.4, 118.3, 74.7, 74.1, 59.5, 12.8. HRMS Calcd. for
C18H19O3 (M+1): 283.1334, Found: 283.1336.FTIR (neat): 3478, 2961, 2925,
1732, 1394, 1257, 1204, 1109, 1020, 915, 778 cm-1. HPLC (Chiralcel OJ-H
column, 2% i-PrOH/hexanes, 0.8 mL/min, 254 nm), tmajor = 17.9 min, tminor
= 24.5 min; ee = 97%. [α]D = + 22.0 (c = 4.30, CH2Cl2).
