$DATUM green chemistry-solvent, Baylis-Hillman reaction
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Efficient Baylis-Hillman reaction using stoichiometric base catalyst and
an aqueous medium
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Yu, Chengzhi; Liu, Bin; Hu, Longqin
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Organic Chemistry (2001), 66(16), 5413-5418

