$DATUM 2-Ethyl-1-(4-nitrophenyl)-2-vinylhexan-1-ol (4e) To a reaction vessel
charged with RuBr(CO)3(η 3-C3H5) (4.5 mg, 0.015 mmol, 5 mol%), t-BuPPh2
(10.9 mg, 0.045 mmol, 15 mol%), aldehyde (45.3 mg, 0.30 mmol, 100 mol%)
and allene (75.0 mg, 0.60 mmol, 200 mol%) was added toluene (0.3 mL, 1.0
M) followed by isopropanol (72.1 mg, 1.20 mmol, 400 mol%). The system was
purged with argon gas and the reaction vessel was sealed. The reaction
mixture was allowed to stir at 75 °C for 11 hours, at which point the
reaction mixture was concentrated in vacuo and the residue was purified
by flash column chromatography (SiO2, 95% toluene:5% EtOAc) to furnish
the title compound (68.0 mg, 0.25 mmol, 82%) as yellow oil (1:1 dr).
yellow oil.TLC (SiO2): Rf = 0.55, 90% Toluene, 10% EtOAc. 1H NMR (400
MHz, CDCl3): 8.12 (d, J = 8.9 Hz, 2H), 8.11 (d, J = 8.9 Hz, 2H), 7.40 (d,
J = 8.9, 4H)*, 5.61 – 5.52 (m, 2H)*, 5.27 (d, J = 10.9 Hz, 2H)*, 5.01 –
4.95 (m, 2H)*, 4.66 (s, 2H)*, 2.18 (s, 2H)*, 1.77 – 0.73 (m, 28H)*. *
Signals overlapped 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3): 149.1, 147.1, 140.9, 140.8,
128.7, 122.5 (two signals), 116.9, 116.8, 47.5, 47.4, 32.0, 31.5, 30.6,
25.5, 25.3, 23.8, 23.5, 23.3, 14.1, 14.0, 7.9, 7.7. HRMS Calcd. for
C16H24NO3 (M+1): 278.1756, Found: 278.1759. FTIR(neat): 3053, 2986, 2305,
2253, 1520, 1349, 1261, 912, 748 cm-1
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
